# mcp-crates project gitattributes file
#  https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md

* text=auto eol=lf

# A benchmark fixture is a byte-exact capture of what a server transferred, and
# a zstd frame that git decided to treat as text would come back out a different
# document. `text=auto` classifies these correctly today only because they
# happen to carry a NUL byte inside git's detection window; saying so outright
# does not leave that to chance.
*.zst binary
